# Here when returned, since the function takes two arguments but the return statement only provides 1,
# the function sum_all will leech the required additional x input argument from the enclosing stack values
func sum_all x acc as
    exit acc x + when depth 2 = # depth keyword return the number of arguments on the stack before the function is called
    set acc as acc x +
    return acc sum_all
output 1 2 3 4 0 sum_all
